  "title": "Discovery Set",
  "body_html": "<p><b><img class=\"alignright wp-image-787 size-medium\" src=\"//mesbisous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Book-of-Discovery-2.webp\" /></b></p>\n<p><strong>Nine Stories in The Book of Discovery.</strong></p>\n<p>Mes Bisous is designed to unveil the most intimate desires you hold within and start your authentic story of temptation. As the unbreakable connection between memories and scents is made in the human brain, each perfume is crafted to evoke and invigorate different ways of your being.</p>\n<p>Our Discovery Set invites you to experience the full soul of Mes Bisous through nine of 3 ML fragrances.</p>\n<div>\n<p><strong>What’s in the Box:</strong></p>\n<p>9 x 3 ml glass vials of our core collection:</p>\n<div>     * A Wondrous Flight</div>\n<div>     * Amberique</div>\n<div>     * Balle Rouge</div>\n<div>     * Crumble Me Softly</div>\n<div>     * One Night Only</div>\n<div>     * Oud Hypnotique</div>\n<div>     * Out Of Reach</div>\n<div>     * Passion Island</div>\n<div>     * Tobacco Flirting With Vanilla</div>\n</div>",
